        "quote": "Every 2027 plan I saw assumed accelerator spend grows faster than total capex; buildings were pulled forward in 2025–26."
      }
    },
    {
      "statement": "The one-third expectation concerns late-2027 new accelerator dollars at two unnamed clouds, with no 2026 figure.",
      "entities": [
        "MSFT",
