      "customer": "GOOGL",
      "relationship_id": "gcp-nvda",
      "interpretation": "Alphabet’s dated Q2 TPU agreements and NVIDIA’s August 26 Google Cloud Rubin relationship anchor competing accelerator offerings.",
      "uncertainty": "External TPU sales may serve customers outside the modeled four. They do not establish Google’s own custom procurement share, displacement of NVIDIA, or the expert’s unnamed-cloud identity.",
      "evidence": [
